{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id577631088"}, "name":{"label":"MattyC96163"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-04-27T12:16:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.8.3"}, "id":{"label":"8612492162"}, "title":{"label":"I absolutely LOVE the concept of achievements!"}, "content":{"label":"This is the best part of this app for me; it serves as a motivator so much more so than the standard Health app that is usually preloaded onto Apple phones. \n\nI would only suggest that there be a way to increase the number and variety of these achievements, or even the ability to create them yourself. All currently accessible achievements are based on straightforward and relatively simple goals such as reaching 100,000 steps; however I suggest that the app could be even more fun and motivational with more creative achievements and simply more of them in general. \n\nAnother idea that would make the app more exciting and motivational would be to publish your rank versus others with the app in an online list, where the #1 spot goes to the person whose phone has recorded the most steps that day, or something similar. Even a comments section would increase the interactivity tremendously.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
