{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id25643485"}, "name":{"label":"\"Legs\" Kathleen"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-03-01T21:50:20-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.8.1"}, "id":{"label":"8411313495"}, "title":{"label":"Personal change"}, "content":{"label":"Your app has reoriented my life, not easy after 67 yrs in same rut driving everywhere. Now I walk just for the reward of confetti’ falling and seeing green column grow through the bar. Yay me!!! Thankyou. After another year of trying to walk daily, I have lost pounds of weight, gained muscle in my legs and my A1C is normal, and my blood pressure is 130/80, my doctors “goals”. Need to keep going, lose 25 more pounds if I can. Dr. Lim says “keep doing what you are doing “. The app motivates me! Thankyou. If I knew how I’d put some $$ into your tip jar. Please send tip jar instructions. I am grateful for your encouragement 😃", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
